![EMS Cart](cover.webp)

A GUI application for ems flasher <http://lacklustre.net/redmine/projects/ems-flash>

The EMS flasher is a simple command line flasher for the 64 Mbit EMS
USB flash cart for Game Boy.

Written by Mike Ryan.

This software is a GUI for that program. Written in
[Gambas Basic](https://gambas.sourceforge.net/en/main.html).

You can purchase an [EMS Cart in Kitsch Bent](https://store.kitsch-bent.com/collections/cartridges-programmers/products/usb-64m-smart-card)

```github
NinjasCL-archive/ems-flasher-gui | Interfaz gráfica en Gambas para el grabador EMS de Game Boy
```
